Levels live here.

L_FarmBlockout.umap is not in the repository: a .umap is a binary asset and
cannot be authored without the Unreal Editor, which was unavailable when this
project was created. Config/DefaultEngine.ini already points GameDefaultMap
and EditorStartupMap at /Game/Levels/L_FarmBlockout.

Create it with Tools/generate_bootstrap_level.py. See KNOWN_ISSUES.md KI-02.
